{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いお着物."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/25/9241498/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2017年1月28日から東京・日本橋茅場町の特設会場で開催されるアート展"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「見て食べる体験型デジタルアート『食神さまの不思議なレストラン』展」にて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/25/9241498/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナビゲーターとして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっつんとWキャストでキツネのキャラクター UKA役の声を担当させて頂きます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっつんは『食』の側面からのサポート、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は『アート』の側面からの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サポートをやらせていただきますっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃ嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"趣味ではありますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵を描くことはとても大好きなこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読売中高生新聞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャンパスアート アワード2016の審査員をさせて頂いたり！！この間 審査ちゃんとしてきましたよー(∗ˊ꒳ˋ∗)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうして 『アート』のお仕事に関われるのは嬉しいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分のデザインの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事をする事も目標なので！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かとコラボしたり、いつか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"形に出来るといいなぁと思ってます。頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに 最近描いた デザイン画"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは空き時間にシャーペンで描きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ描こう、これ描こうと思って描くタイプじゃない為...テーマは『還元か起源』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/25/9241498/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"team UKA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/25/9241498/0003.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}